session -> window -> pane

list available sessions:
tmux ls

immediately go to any session:
tmux a -t [number]

rename session:
c-b $

detatch / quit tmux / quit session:
c-b d

new window:
c-b c

rename window:
c-b ,

split pane:
c-b " horizontal
c-b % vertical

switch pane:
c-b arrow keys
c-b q [number]

resize pane:
hold c-b arrow keys

move around all sessions and windows
c-b w
